OL,3,GNEWSAPopular Thames towpath open after
OL,4,Aessential works
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmergency repairs to a popular section
OL,7,Fof towpath along the River Thames have
OL,8,Fbeen completed.
OL,10,FThe Thames path in Oxford had been shut
OL,11,Fbetween the Isis Farmhouse pub and
OL,12,FDonnington Bridge for urgent repairs
OL,13,Fsince August.
OL,15,FWork had initially been scheduled for
OL,16,F2027, but Oxfordshire County Council
OL,17,Fsaid it moved the project forward to
OL,18,Fdue public safety concerns.
OL,20,FThe project was completed last month,
OL,21,Fwith the river wall repairs finished
OL,22,Fand the route reopened to pedestrians.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
